 is the opposite of \"happy\"?","options":[{"image":"😊","value":"happy","text":"Happy"},{"image":"😢","value":"sad","text":"Sad"},{"image":"😴","value":"sleepy","text":"Sleepy"}],"correctAnswer":"sad"},{"id":"l1_b05_q3","type":"image_choice","question":"What is the opposite of \"hot\"?","options":[{"image":"🔥","value":"hot","text":"Hot"},{"image":"❄️","value":"cold","text":"Cold"},{"image":"💨","value":"windy","text":"Windy"}],"correctAnswer":"cold"}],"rewards":{"magicPower":25,"cards":["word_master"]},"metadata":{"wordCount":22,"estimatedTime":2,"difficulty":1.2}},{"id":"l1_boss","level":1,"regionId":"region_l1","title":"Forest Guardian","titleCn":"森林守护者","coverImage":"/images/stories/l1/forest-guardian.webp","audioFile":"/audio/stories/l1/forest-guardian.mp3","nodeType":"boss","content":[{"paragraphId":"l1_boss_p1","text":"Deep in the forest lives a magical owl. He is the Forest Guardian.","translation":"在森林深处住着一只神奇的猫头鹰。他是森林守护者。","audioStart":0,"audioEnd":6000,"words":[{"word":"Deep","start":0,"end":400,"index":0},{"word":"in","start":400,"end":550,"index":1},{"word":"the","start":550,"end":700,"index":2},{"word":"forest","start":700,"end":1200,"index":3},{"word":"lives","start":1200,"end":1600,"index":4},{"word":"a","start":1600,"end":1700,"index":5},{"word":"magical","start":1700,"end":2300,"index":6},{"word":"owl.","start":2300,"end":3000,"index":7},{"word":"He","start":3200,"end":3450,"index":8},{"word":"is","start":3450,"end":3650,"index":9},{"word":"the","start":3650,"end":3800,"index":10},{"word":"Forest","start":3800,"end":4300,"index":11},{"word":"Guardian.","start":4300,"end":6000,"index":12}]},{"paragraphId":"l1_boss_p2","text":"The owl is big and wise. His eyes are yellow. His feathers are brown.","translation":"猫头鹰又大又聪明。他的眼睛是黄色的。他的羽毛是棕色的。","audioStart":6500,"audioEnd":13000,"words":[{"word":"The","start":6500,"end":6700,"index":0},{"word":"owl","start":6700,"end":7100,"index":1},{"word":"is","start":7100,"end":7300,"index":2},{"word":"big","start":7300,"